# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Local environment. Vite bakes VITE_* into the bundle at build time, so a
# committed .env is not a secret leak but it is worse: it silently decides what
# every build points at. Production values come from CI secrets instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

